{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Traffluent\/documentation\/Traffluent\/PrivacyManifests","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"article","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Traffluent collects nothing on its own. It records only the events your app tracks and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"context your app turns on: every kind of automatic instrumentation and every standard enricher is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"opt in. It sends records only to the destinations your app gives a delivery, to endpoints your app"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"names. None of it is used for tracking as Apple defines it: no module links what it records with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"other companies’ data, reads the advertising identifier, fingerprints the device, or works around"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the user’s consent or App Tracking Transparency. Every manifest declares "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSPrivacyTracking"},{"type":"text","text":" as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"type":"text","text":" and lists no tracking domains."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each module that can produce data of one of Apple’s collected data types ships a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PrivacyInfo.xcprivacy"},{"type":"text","text":" declaring it. SwiftPM and Bazel both put it in a resource bundle named"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Traffluent_<Module>.bundle"},{"type":"text","text":", which Xcode and rules_apple copy into your app, where Xcode’s privacy"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"report finds it. A module your app doesn’t link adds nothing to the report."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Required-reason APIs","level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Required-reason-APIs"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"No Traffluent module calls an API on Apple’s list of required-reason APIs, so every manifest’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"NSPrivacyAccessedAPITypes","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is empty. The list’s categories are file timestamps","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"code":"NSPrivacyAccessedAPICategoryFileTimestamp","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), system boot time","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"code":"NSPrivacyAccessedAPICategorySystemBootTime","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), disk space","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"code":"NSPrivacyAccessedAPICategoryDiskSpace","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), active keyboards","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"code":"NSPrivacyAccessedAPICategoryActiveKeyboards","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") and user defaults","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"code":"NSPrivacyAccessedAPICategoryUserDefaults","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"). The modules that come nearest:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"header":"row","type":"table","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Module"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"What it calls","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Why none is a required-reason API"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"swift-system’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FileDescriptor"},{"text":" (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"open"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"read"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"write"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"seek"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"resize"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"close"},{"text":"), ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"fsync"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"unlink"},{"text":", and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FileManager"},{"text":"’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"createDirectory"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"setAttributes"},{"text":" (the file protection class), ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"contentsOfDirectory"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isExcludedFromBackup"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"It reads no file’s timestamps, size from ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"stat"},{"text":", or the volume’s free space: a segment’s size is the offset ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"seek"},{"text":" returns at its end, and the store bounds itself by the bytes it has written.","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FileManager.fileExists"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Data(contentsOf:)"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Data.write(to:options:)"},{"text":" in ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FileVersionStore"},{"text":"; ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ProcessInfo.performExpiringActivity"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It reads and writes the version file’s contents, never its attributes."}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"sysctlbyname","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for ","type":"text"},{"code":"hw.machine","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"hw.model","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"ProcessInfo.operatingSystemVersion","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"Bundle.infoDictionary","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"Locale.current","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"NWPathMonitor","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"identifierForVendor","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"None is on the list; "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Enricher.vendorIdentifier()"},{"type":"text","text":" is declared as collected data below."}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The tracker’s record timestamps (","type":"text"},{"code":"Date","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":")","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A session’s inactivity is measured between records’ wall-clock timestamps, not from the system’s uptime.","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","type":"reference","isActive":true}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Date.now"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Wall-clock time, not boot time.","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ContinuousClock"},{"text":", the default clock of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"batch()"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The Swift runtime’s clock, which isn’t on the list."}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GRDBPersistence\/documentation\/GRDBPersistence","isActive":true}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"GRDB"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"GRDB ships a privacy manifest of its own.","type":"text"}]}]]]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every other module calls nothing near the list. Of the packages Traffluent depends on,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"swift-system’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Stat"},{"type":"text","text":" API ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FilePath.stat()"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FileDescriptor.stat()"},{"type":"text","text":") calls "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"stat"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"fstat"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"lstat"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"fstatat"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"statfs"},{"type":"text","text":". Traffluent calls none of it. If your app does, your manifest"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"declares the file timestamp or disk space reason it needs."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Collected data","level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Collected-data"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every declaration below is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeLinked"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"type":"text","text":" (Traffluent links nothing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to the user’s identity), "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeTracking"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"type":"text","text":", and has the one purpose"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypePurposeAnalytics"},{"type":"text","text":". A module declares a type only when it makes data of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that type itself; it is collected only once your app turns the module on and delivers the records"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"off the device."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"header":"row","type":"table","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Module"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Data type"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"What it makes, once your app turns it on"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Device ID ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeDeviceID"},{"type":"text","text":")"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Enricher.vendorIdentifier()"},{"text":": the platform’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"identifierForVendor"},{"text":", as a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sensitive"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"VendorIdentifierKey"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Other Diagnostic Data ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeOtherDiagnosticData"},{"type":"text","text":")"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Enricher.application()"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"device()"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"operatingSystem()"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"network()"},{"type":"text","text":": the app’s bundle identifier, version and build; the device’s model and form factor; the operating system’s name and version; and the kind of network connection."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Other Data Types (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeOtherDataTypes"},{"text":")","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"Enricher.locale()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": the user’s locale.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftUITracking\/documentation\/SwiftUITracking"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Product Interaction ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeProductInteraction"},{"type":"text","text":")"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"trackScreen(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":"’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ScreenViewed"},{"type":"text","text":", and the events "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"trackOnAppear(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"trackOnTap(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"trackChange(of:_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" track as the user moves through the app."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/UIKitTracking\/documentation\/UIKitTracking"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Product Interaction"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The events ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UIControl.track(_:for:)"},{"text":" tracks when a control’s action fires.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AppKitTracking\/documentation\/AppKitTracking","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Product Interaction","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The events "},{"code":"NSControl.track(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" tracks when a control sends its action."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AutomaticScreenTracking\/documentation\/AutomaticScreenTracking"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Product Interaction"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"trackScreensAutomatically"},{"type":"text","text":": a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ScreenViewed"},{"type":"text","text":" per screen, named after its view controller or SwiftUI view type."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AutomaticControlTracking\/documentation\/AutomaticControlTracking","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Product Interaction"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"trackControlsAutomatically"},{"text":": a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ControlActivated"},{"text":" per touch that activates a control, named by its accessibility identifier, never its text.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking","type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Product Interaction","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"trackLifecycle"},{"type":"text","text":": the app’s installs, updates (with the versions), opens, moves to the background and terminations."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Product Interaction"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"Enricher.sessions(timeout:kinds:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": a random session identifier held in memory only, and ","type":"text"},{"code":"SessionStarted","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"SessionEnded","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" with the session’s duration.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The rest ship no manifest: ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GRDBPersistence\/documentation\/GRDBPersistence","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Checksums\/documentation\/Checksums","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/LoggingDestinations\/documentation\/LoggingDestinations","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TracingDestinations\/documentation\/TracingDestinations","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/PostHogEncoding\/documentation\/PostHogEncoding","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AmplitudeEncoding\/documentation\/AmplitudeEncoding","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MixpanelEncoding\/documentation\/MixpanelEncoding","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/PropertyJSON\/documentation\/PropertyJSON","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/JSONValues\/documentation\/JSONValues","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/EventMacros\/documentation\/EventMacros","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlanTesting\/documentation\/TrackingPlanTesting","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" neither call a required-reason API nor make data of their own. They carry,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"store and send the events and context your app and the modules above make.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Your app’s manifest and privacy labels","level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Your-apps-manifest-and-privacy-labels"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Traffluent’s manifests cover what its modules make. Your app’s manifest and its App Store privacy","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"labels also cover what your app adds:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Your events."}]},{"type":"text","text":" Each event type your app tracks is data your app collects: declare the type its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"properties hold (Product Interaction for taps and views, Purchase History for an order, and so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"on)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Your identifiers."}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" An identifier your app adds with an enricher of its own, such as an account","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"identifier, is a User ID, linked to the user (","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Traffluent\/documentation\/Traffluent\/IdentifyingPeople","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":").","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Your destinations.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" Where your destinations send records decides whether the data leaves the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"device, and whether a third party receives it. If an endpoint you send to uses the data for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracking, your app’s manifest lists its domain under "},{"code":"NSPrivacyTrackingDomains","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", and your app"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"asks for permission through App Tracking Transparency first."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Modules you turn off."}]},{"text":" If your app links a module but never turns it on, it collects nothing","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"through it, and your privacy labels can leave that data out.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"What each module can collect, the required-reason APIs it calls, and the privacy manifest it ships, so you can fill in your app’s own manifest and privacy labels.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Traffluent\/documentation\/Traffluent"]]},"metadata":{"title":"Privacy Manifests","modules":[{"name":"Traffluent"}],"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article"},"variants":[{"paths":